Package: statarbor
Title: Assumption-Guided Statistical Decision Engine with Automated CLD and Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Taha",
           family = "BAŞTUĞ",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tahabastug@protonmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2382-6302"))
Description: Provides an assumption-guided statistical workflow for biological,
    agricultural, and experimental datasets. Automatically evaluates group-level
    normality, variance homogeneity, and zero-variance conditions to route
    analyses across one-way ANOVA (Tukey HSD), Welch ANOVA (Games-Howell), and
    Kruskal-Wallis (Dunn) tests, while generating special-character-safe compact
    letter displays (CLD), effect sizes, reproducible R scripts, academic
    methods text, and an interactive bilingual (EN/TR) Shiny interface.
